=== volume ls after deploy :: $ ployz volume ls
VOLUME   STORAGE                         SHARED WRITES   MOUNTS      DEPLOYED   NEXT DEPLOY
store    Docker volume (no size limit)   on              api:/data   ✔ yes      -

